      "mantra": "- Invariant: Fix nums[i] in a sorted array, reducing subproblem to monotonic inward two-pointer target matching for -nums[i].\n- Mechanics: Sort array; iterate index i and sweep left/right pointers inwardly; increment left or decrement right based on sum comparison.\n- Edge: Increment and decrement pointers past identical consecutive values to prevent duplicate triplet entries in output.",
