      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "bounds": "Time Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ | Space Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(H)$",
      "mantra": "- Root-Left-Right traversal processes parent state before descending to child subtrees.\n- Iterative stack approach pushes right child before left child to preserve visit order.\n- Empty tree requires immediate base check returning an empty list.",
