      "bounds": "Time Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ | Space Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
      "mantra": "- Preorder pointer designates current subtree root; locate root in inorder array to determine subtree sizes.\n- Hash map provides O(1) index lookups for root positions in inorder sequence.\n- Recurse on left range [in_start, root_idx - 1] and right range [root_idx + 1, in_end].",
      "leetcode": "https://leetcode.com/problems/construct-binary-tree-from-preorder-and-inorder-traversal/",
