      "bounds": "Time Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(H + k)$ | Space Complexity: $\\mathcal{O}(H)$",
      "mantra": "- Apply symmetric in-order traversals for ascending and descending rank queries.\n- Standard in-order (L-Root-R) locates $k$-th smallest; reverse in-order (R-Root-L) locates $k$-th largest.\n- Reverse in-order avoids counting total tree nodes $N$ beforehand.",
